WEBVTT

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.726
So here's my crazy idea.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.293
I think business should step up.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:08.321
I think business should fix capitalism.

00:04:08.861 --> 00:04:10.338
I know.
(Laughs)

00:04:10.362 --> 00:04:14.518
Some of you are probably
thinking, "Fat chance."

00:04:15.237 --> 00:04:19.536
Didn't I just say that companies
are the ones denying the science,

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.766
distorting the market
and lobbying the politicians?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.043
I did.

00:04:24.817 --> 00:04:29.314
But fixing this is squarely
in the private sector's interest.

00:04:29.789 --> 00:04:35.274
The truth is business is screwed
if we don't fix climate change.